                                "sense_id": "38ef9dfd-6430-3347-9e9c-591b0b3472f9",
                                "text": "Here's a Humbugger come, / Will prove the reſt nothing at all, / 'Tis a Jobber, a Factor, / A damn'd Corn Contractor, / Who makes all our Loaves be ſo ſmall; […]"
